        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's one thing to compose fascinating stories with unusual characters, but it's quite another to encounter them in real life! The aspiring writer Kosmeya worked on his manuscript for a whole year, but a bad memory, washed-out roads and a creepy forest turned the journey to the Festival of Words into a real adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hero will have to meet a new friend, escape from the witch's curse, get out of the forest, and most importantly, have time to present his work to the jury at the most important writing competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know a kind and touching story about not giving up and that your dream will definitely come true. Test your attentiveness in a mini-game of find objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 8 chapters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > colorful drawing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > hidden object game</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's one thing to compose fascinating stories with unusual characters, but it's quite another to encounter them in real life! The aspiring writer Kosmeya worked on his manuscript for a whole year, but a bad memory, washed-out roads and a creepy forest turned the journey to the Festival of Words into a real adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hero will have to meet a new friend, escape from the witch's curse, get out of the forest, and most importantly, have time to present his work to the jury at the most important writing competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know a kind and touching story about not giving up and that your dream will definitely come true. Test your attentiveness in a mini-game of find objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 8 chapters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > colorful drawing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > hidden object game</p></li></ul>",
